. local txt "Notes: Start = first year seen exporting after a year seen not exporting (2016 starts count as 2017). Each 
> dot = one start"

. local txt "`txt' year, from up to `=-`wlo'' years before the start to up to +`whi' from it; never-exporters = firms ne
> ver seen exporting (earlier"

. local txt "`txt' starters are never the comparison). Bars = 95% intervals; crossing 0 = no clear difference. Averages 
> weighted by starters:"

